                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "UNCORPOREAL - \"Alcatraz Island Lofts\" Experienced on the HTC Vive and Worked on my system. \n\nPro tip: press Spacebar to start experience. There is No mention of this on the title screen and took me a while to figure out how to start the experience correctly. \n\nThis is about a 1.5 minute VR short cinematic experience. The environment is a futuristic inspired take on an apartment loft in Alcatraz Island that is up for sale. You are an invisible potential buyer where a real estate agent lady tries to sell you on making an offer.  I found the monologue sort of funny. The visuals in the apartment loft were good.  The real estate agent doesn't look as good. I don't mean she's unattractive, I just mean the quality of the animations there are subpar compared to the rest of the visuals. \n\nTry it and delete it.",
